OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies in early morning
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has died and two other people
OL,7,Fhave been seriously injured after an
OL,8,Fearly morning multi-vehicle crash.
OL,10,FThe collision took place on the A605
OL,11,Fbetween Warmington in Northamptonshire
OL,12,Fand Elton in Cambridgeshire at about
OL,13,F01:30 GMT.
OL,15,FNorthamptonshire Police said a BMW 2
OL,16,Fand BMW X6 were being driven in
OL,17,Fopposite directions when they crashed.
OL,18,FThe drivers of two HGVs stopped to help
OL,19,Fand a Kia Ceed then collided with the
OL,20,Fstationary BMW 2.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
